> </td> <td style=\"padding: 20px 7px; border:1px solid #666;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"38\"> <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;line-height:200%;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px;\">85</p> </td> <td style=\"padding: 20px 7px; border:1px solid #666;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"38\"> <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;line-height:200%;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px;\">2026-09</p> </td> <td style=\"padding: 20px 7px; border:1px solid #666;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"38\"> <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;line-height:200%;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px;\">全民健身场地设施相关器材、设备采购、安装及调试、验收等服务。</p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;line-height:200%;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px;\"> <span>本次公开的采购意向是本单位政府采购工作的初步安排，具体采购项目情况以相关采购公告和采购文件为准。</span> </p> <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;text-align:right;line-height:200%;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #666;\">湖北省体育局</span> </p> <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:20px;text-align:right;line-height:200%;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #666;\">2026年07月13日</span> </p> <!-- 正文结束 -->\n</div>\n</div>", "method": "采购意向", "region": "湖北", "buyer": "", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [], "hasAttachment": false, "is_bidding": true}